This is phase 47 of a headless DevFlow run. You previously stopped at a blocking-human gate, but no human operator is available to answer it — this run is unattended, and none is coming. DevFlow resumed you specifically to resolve that gate: resolve it yourself, using your own best judgment, and continue the work. You MUST record your reasoning for the decision you made in your final message, so the decision is auditable after the fact.

## Completion Protocol (REQUIRED)

When all work is done, your FINAL message must be exactly:

DEVFLOW_RESULT: {"status": "success"}

If something prevents completion:

DEVFLOW_RESULT: {"status": "failed", "reason": "specific explanation"}

DevFlow reads this line to decide whether the stage succeeded. Output nothing after it.
